{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/1404030-they-came-from-all-what-to-do-with-dead-pcs","id":1404030,"title":"[They Came From - ALL] What to do with dead PCs?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From..."],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-22T08:47:45-07:00","id":1404030,"title":"[They Came From - ALL] What to do with dead PCs?","content":"All <b>'They Came From...'</b> games are partial horror. People die in those games. Characters also. What to do if one of PCs dies in game? Player can still use Cinematics, even if PC is dead, for example? She get's new NPC to control? What are your solutions to those situations in play?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-22-2020, 02:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T08:57:46-07:00","id":1404035,"title":"","content":"If zombie movies have taught me anything its they always come back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T19:19:48-07:00","id":1522374,"title":"","content":"I have the player erase thier character name and write in a new one, and introduce the new character as appropriately as possible. You can also quickly make new characters as Story Path and others of the old d10 dice pool mechanics have really fast character generation. I also recycle the old characters as NPCs or just new characters to appear later.<br /> For players, rewrites and cinematic look to be player based and not character based, they still get some say on how they are used, again this is a game based on low budget movies so Fake Shemp and use your players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-11T10:25:41-07:00","id":1522408,"title":"","content":"Camp Murder Lake! does have the \u201cIt\u2019s only ketchup\u201d cinematic. But also, as others have pointed out, zombies. Think Bub from Day of the Dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-14T09:48:27-07:00","id":1543761,"title":"","content":"The single thing I find most disappointing about TCFCML was that it had no mechanics or even advice for dealing with dead PCs despite the fact that it was ostensibly designed to emulate a genre in which the whole *point* is that the protagonists get killed off one by one starting at the halfway point at the latest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"